---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Work With Me" description="A free 30-minute conversation about where you are and whether working together makes sense.">
  <article class="container section">
    <h1 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">Work With Me</h1>

    <div style="max-width: 65ch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-xl);">
      <p>If you're building something real and running into the same ceiling — this is the conversation worth having.</p>

      <p>I work with a small number of founders and operators on an ongoing basis. Strategy, systems, process, and AI — whatever the gap actually is.</p>

      <p>Ready to work on it? Start with a free 30-minute call. We'll figure out the rest from there.</p>

      <a href="https://calendly.com/damdug/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--accent" style="display: inline-block; max-width: fit-content;">
        Book a free 30-minute call →
      </a>

      <hr />

      <div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Working on something larger?</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Organizational systems, intelligence infrastructure, AI governance for your team — that's a different conversation.</p>
        <a href="/contact" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--accent);">Get in touch directly →</a>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-tertiary);">
        Douglas M. Galloway is co-founder of <a href="https://www.esoteriaai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--text-tertiary); text-decoration: underline;">esoteriaai.com</a> — intelligence infrastructure for mission-driven organizations across the US-Mexico corridor.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
